  "excerptEn": "Eurowindow automatic floor hinge doors are the ideal choice for office buildings, commercial centers, showrooms, restaurants, and high-end townhouses, especially suitable for main lobby entrances that require high aesthetics and convenient operation.",
  "contentEn": "<img alt=\"Eurowindow\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"638\" data-original-width=\"894\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh6NK0SCWHJule4SJjPRYMxs9ZkZ-U1xazAF1IKvVP_w01cP3TL1LoNULdeeLPiu8dq-WbQG7AN1KQLViRUEW6gjUZLS_WHUDlZGMeba4iVC07NCJTUG-Rc_ssqFo3EZVKmmc4L4_DjiKOxjvkq8e1t2pf5oVrKVEAlX2ElsUCBCZb4z4TmgMRDo_81swQf/s880/bls-tu-dong-1.webp\" title=\"Eurowindow Automatic Floor Hinge Doors\" />\n<p></p><p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >Eurowindow automatic floor hinge doors are the ideal choice for office buildings, commercial centers, showrooms, restaurants, and high-end townhouses, especially suitable for main lobby entrances that require high aesthetics and convenient operation.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span >Outstanding Features<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span >Saving Area – Expanding Space<br />\n</span></b><span >The doors have a customizable opening angle of up to 90°, making them easy to install in narrow areas, optimizing the flow of movement.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"></p><div className=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiuH7wwGBWvZeF5RIhxFR3Nx4QUgFQDiCCm16i0xpMAE9w_j7s4GhgAUZufd2aNqiGglwHZtiNewd3Ou7zKPCgaZa977-MQOgtNtlSSLgC8mQK3Mx-w7TUv6LNoQm0rSxOm-PZedBeyUjscqZU3ZkR2IuucVaTvo50Ea8QtMb-qGl1iy2nfJvB2q0kQtK6M/s880/bls-tu-dong-2.webp\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"Eurowindow Automatic Floor Hinge Doors\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"880\" data-original-width=\"880\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiuH7wwGBWvZeF5RIhxFR3Nx4QUgFQDiCCm16i0xpMAE9w_j7s4GhgAUZufd2aNqiGglwHZtiNewd3Ou7zKPCgaZa977-MQOgtNtlSSLgC8mQK3Mx-w7TUv6LNoQm0rSxOm-PZedBeyUjscqZU3ZkR2IuucVaTvo50Ea8QtMb-qGl1iy2nfJvB2q0kQtK6M/s16000/bls-tu-dong-2.webp\" title=\"Eurowindow Automatic Floor Hinge Doors\" /></a></div><span ><br /></span><p></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span >Smart, Flexible Operation<br />\n</span></b><span >A 3-sensor safety system:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >- Motion sensor detects people, automatically opening the door<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >- Obstacle sensor stops or reverses when encountering an obstacle<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >- Convenient two-way automatic opening and closing mode<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span >Multiple Control Methods</span></b><span ><br />\nCustomers can choose remote control, fixed push buttons, or fully automatic mode – flexible for all needs.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"></p><div className=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjF1bv1TY5Td_uyNA5FhjyBvuPr2rbulMrvI_J4zpNHoiO7_GrdyHI1wuCe6eKzP9YhUyhT8FAh8NLMhwKJNe-dJEgQ_zWXD8N0TeTjMS5uyQ-ixqFnij-1uYpzRfuEljBID1cxaztQ6b0nukJz48f4-NRno2_QZ_txrfmrl-n6_II6ZxJals5fEQJiMgUW/s880/bls-tu-dong-3.webp\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"Eurowindow Automatic Floor Hinge Doors\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"880\" data-original-width=\"880\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjF1bv1TY5Td_uyNA5FhjyBvuPr2rbulMrvI_J4zpNHoiO7_GrdyHI1wuCe6eKzP9YhUyhT8FAh8NLMhwKJNe-dJEgQ_zWXD8N0TeTjMS5uyQ-ixqFnij-1uYpzRfuEljBID1cxaztQ6b0nukJz48f4-NRno2_QZ_txrfmrl-n6_II6ZxJals5fEQJiMgUW/s16000/bls-tu-dong-3.webp\" title=\"Eurowindow Automatic Floor Hinge Doors\" /></a></div><br /><p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span >Safety and Building System Synchronization</span></b><span ><br />\nEurowindow automatic floor hinge doors can be integrated with the fire alarm system, ensuring maximum safety, and meeting the IP6 standard for underground motors.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span >Standard Technical Specifications<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >Mechanical floor hinge doors: Maximum width 1350 mm, maximum height 3500 mm, maximum load 180 kg.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >Automatic floor hinge doors: Maximum width 1200 mm, maximum height 3500 mm, maximum load 150 kg.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >Underground motor design, airtight, offering outstanding dust and water resistance.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:.0001pt; margin-bottom: 0in;\"><span >Eurowindow exclusively develops the BLS60 automatic and mechanical floor hinge systems, ensuring durability and synchronization, overcoming the disadvantages of conventional imported profiles. This is a pioneering solution, opening up modern automatic door options for high-end architectural spaces.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p className=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p> </o:p></p>"
